WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:03.120
We have this information: our CAD plans.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:11.060
We also have architectural plans, BIM models, geographic databases and even inventory systems.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.760
But each one tells a completely different story.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.240
My challenge today is to connect them.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:23.460
With ArcGIS Indoors, we can create this model, or digital twin, by combining BIM and GIS.

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:24.540
Let me show you.
